Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific networking configuration]

Remove an interface wildcard that BusyBox ifupdown treats as a literal
interface name.  eth0 already has an explicit DHCP configuration.

--- a/interfaces
+++ b/interfaces
@@ -21,4 +21 @@
-# Busybox ifupdown won't process /en* correctly
-auto /en*=eth
-iface eth inet dhcp
-
+# Configure Ethernet interfaces explicitly; BusyBox ifupdown does not expand globs.
